  sitemap.xml
  A sitemap helps search engines understand the structure of your website.
  It lists every page with:
    - loc       : the full URL of the page
    - lastmod   : when the page was last updated
    - changefreq: how often the page content changes
    - priority  : importance of the page relative to others (0.0 to 1.0)
-->
